3601     {\cf20 // [EXPERIMENTAL] High-Level: Input Access functions w/ support for Key/Input Ownership}\par
3602     {\cf20 // - Important: legacy IsKeyPressed(ImGuiKey, bool repeat=true) _DEFAULTS_ to repeat, new IsKeyPressed() requires _EXPLICIT_ ImGuiInputFlags_Repeat flag.}\par
3603     {\cf20 // - Expected to be later promoted to public API, the prototypes are designed to replace existing ones (since owner_id can default to Any == 0)}\par
3604     {\cf20 // - Specifying a value for 'ImGuiID owner' will test that EITHER the key is NOT owned (UNLESS locked), EITHER the key is owned by 'owner'.}\par
3605     {\cf20 //   Legacy functions use ImGuiKeyOwner_Any meaning that they typically ignore ownership, unless a call to SetKeyOwner() explicitly used ImGuiInputFlags_LockThisFrame or ImGuiInputFlags_LockUntilRelease.}\par
3606     {\cf20 // - Binding generators may want to ignore those for now, or suffix them with Ex() until we decide if this gets moved into public API.}\par
